WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:02.629
Is anyone else sick to death of politics?

00:00:02.629 --> 00:00:06.790
While every politician out there claims that
they work for their constituents, it’s become

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:11.110
increasingly clear over the years that all
they really care about is enriching themselves

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:17.090
and making even more money for the giant,
shady corporations who fund their campaigns.

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:21.030
And with people, understandably, becoming
increasingly disenchanted with the endless

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:26.640
bickering and division of the two-party system,
people wish they had an alternative.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:31.449
Rather than a politician who claims to be
a good person but is actually secretly evil,

00:00:31.449 --> 00:00:36.840
what if, instead, we elected an entity that
we all knew was evil from the beginning?

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:40.530
That’s why today, we’re hitting the anomalous
campaign trail.

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:45.230
Seeing what an utter disaster the world seems
to have been lately, a number of the SCP Foundation’s

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:49.840
most bizarre anomalies have decided that they
could do as good a job as anyone else running

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:51.220
for office right now.

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:56.590
So, let’s hear them out, see what their
campaign promises are, and what fringe new

00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:57.590
parties they’re representing.

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:58.670
And of course, we’re a Democracy here at
SCP Explained, as long as we like the results.

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:03.180
So we want to hear from you, the viewers,
on which anomaly has secured your vote and

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:04.180
why!

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:08.110
And with that, let’s put on our political
correspondent hat and get knee-deep into the

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:14.369
dirty, horrific world of these potential Super
Creepy Presidents - Or SCPs.

00:01:14.369 --> 00:01:18.520
First of all, we have the most experienced
political operative at the SCP Foundation:

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:22.420
Dr. Jack Bright, representing the “C’mon,
You’ve Had Worse!”

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:23.420
party.

00:01:23.420 --> 00:01:27.270
Unlike all of the other anomalies on this
list, if you elect Dr. Bright, this will technically

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:31.909
be his second term in office, given that he
controlled the body of former President George

00:01:31.909 --> 00:01:35.180
W. Bush throughout his eight-year presidential
term.

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:39.920
So if you’re willing to overlook the whole
Iraq War thing, he’s got that killer experience.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:44.049
And hey, for the kind of person who wants
an Everyman President, then Dr. Bright is

00:01:44.049 --> 00:01:48.580
the ideal candidate for you - Seeing as he’s
literally occupied the body of every type

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.140
of man, woman, child, and some animals.

00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:55.570
No matter who you are, Dr. Bright can relate
to your plight.

00:01:55.570 --> 00:02:00.250
But maybe, despite his experience, Dr. Bright
still seems like too much of a young buck

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:02.320
to be the leader of the free world.

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:06.900
You want someone sagely and experienced - and
you don’t want to break the streak of having

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:10.599
all world leaders be tapioca-munching senior
citizens.

00:02:10.599 --> 00:02:15.520
May we introduce to you SCP-106 of The Pocket
Dimension Party.

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:20.629
He’s an older gentleman, sure, but it’s
given him wisdom that youth could never replicate

00:02:20.629 --> 00:02:24.470
- at least in terms of knowing how to torture
people with terrifying efficacy.

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:29.599
He’s also a veteran, having fought and sustained
injuries in the trenches of World War One,

00:02:29.599 --> 00:02:33.330
so he’s got the interest of the nation’s
disaffected veterans in mind.

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:38.870
He’s also committed to transparency and
breaking down boundaries - or at least, walking

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:40.629
directly through them.

00:02:40.629 --> 00:02:45.510
The biggest downsides of having SCP-106 as
president is the fact he’s a little forgetful

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:51.239
in his old age, and also, every month, he
demands 14 live sacrifices from the US citizenry,

00:02:51.239 --> 00:02:56.311
because the job is stressful, he needs to
blow off steam, and he just can’t stand

00:02:56.311 --> 00:02:57.670
playing golf.

00:02:57.670 --> 00:03:03.200
But hey, maybe, like a lot of people out there,
your biggest concern on the ballot is healthcare.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:08.000
You want to know that your pre-existing conditions
will be covered and that if you end up getting

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:12.020
sick, your treatment will be both effective
and affordable.

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:17.599
You also want to guarantee quick responses
to emerging viral threats, like, say, a Pestilence.

00:03:17.599 --> 00:03:23.410
That’s why you might want to cast your vote
for SCP-049, the Plague Doctor, from the End

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:24.780
the Pestilence Party.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:29.220
Sure, this charming French gentleman may not
have been born in the US, but some rules are

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:31.860
worth bending for the sake of the greater
good.

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:36.319
The Plague Doctor wants to ensure that the
nation and the world are healthy and happy,

00:03:36.319 --> 00:03:39.870
no matter how many people he needs to kill
and turn into zombies to do it.

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:44.819
He’s also polite, intelligent, and dignified,
for those who want to add a nice little touch

00:03:44.819 --> 00:03:47.549
of European class to the Oval Office.

00:03:47.549 --> 00:03:51.069
But perhaps you’re not in it for superficial
qualities.

00:03:51.069 --> 00:03:55.629
Maybe you want a president whose every action
comes from a deep well of empathy, and a desire

00:03:55.629 --> 00:03:57.629
to make other people happy.

00:03:57.629 --> 00:04:01.750
If this sounds like it reflects your personal
opinions and beliefs, then it’s time to

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:07.830
cast your vote for SCP-999, the Tickle Monster,
from the Cuddles for Everyone Party.

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:13.770
999 runs on a strict anti-war platform, instead
hoping to spread love and care among the nation’s

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:19.340
citizens and make the desire to uplift others
part of everyone’s sense of civic duty.

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:24.740
SCP-999 also has big plans for investing in
mental health services, owing to his own long

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:29.380
history working in the field, with a particular
view towards treating people suffering from

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:31.130
depression and PTSD.

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:36.240
Then again, maybe all this talk of love and
flower power has you rolling your eyes.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:40.680
Maybe you’re someone who fundamentally has
contempt for the human race and wants to vote

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:45.949
for any candidate who’s eager to speed run
us to complete and utter destruction - cause

00:04:45.949 --> 00:04:49.240
hey, we had our chance, and we fumbled the
ball.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.440
If you agree with this:

00:04:50.440 --> 00:04:51.440
A.

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:52.440
You’re pretty scary.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:53.440
Please stay away from us.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:59.770
And B. You’re gonna love SCP-682, the Hard
to Destroy Reptile, the front runner of the

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.750
Complete Omnicide Party.

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:05.699
His campaign promises include reinstating
the national death penalty and making breathing

00:05:05.699 --> 00:05:10.630
a capital offense, poisoning the water supply,
and launching all the nukes at once, turning

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:13.539
the surface of the earth into lifeless blown
glass.

00:05:13.539 --> 00:05:15.850
Hey, at least he’s honest.

00:05:15.850 --> 00:05:17.600
We can give him that much.

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:21.760
Maybe you don’t want to destroy the human
race out of sheer, unending hatred, but you

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:24.620
are sick of what a circus politics has become.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:29.360
It’s a reality show these days - Politicians
aren’t here to fight for your rights and

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:32.540
privileges, they’re here to fight for airtime.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:39.370
But this isn’t the case with our next presidential
hopeful: SCP-096, the Shy Guy, from the “Oh

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:41.310
god, please, don’t look at me, you doomed
fools!”

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:42.310
party.

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:46.110
He’s not a camera hog - in fact, he’ll
literally annihilate anyone who looks at him.

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:49.919
You’ll find him thoughtfully pacing back
and forth in the Oval Office, muttering to

00:05:49.919 --> 00:05:52.150
himself, like Abraham Lincoln, or Nixon.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:56.300
His aides will get most of the work done,
cause he’ll be too busy sobbing.

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:58.169
Relatable, right?

00:05:58.169 --> 00:06:00.130
Haha, we have fun here.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:04.370
So this next candidate isn’t actually an
anomaly, but he did threaten to break my legs

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:09.910
if I didn’t let him join in, so please,
we present to you, presidential hopeful Dr.

00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:14.120
Alto Clef, of the Shoot First, Ask Questions
Later Party.

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:19.319
Being an ex-member of the Global Occult Coalition,
Clef has experience with bureaucracy and being

00:06:19.319 --> 00:06:24.260
a government insider, even though his method
of interacting with these systems is typically

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:26.849
extreme, gung-ho violence.

00:06:26.849 --> 00:06:31.131
One of Dr. Clef’s major platforms is Gun
Control - as in, when he’s in control, everyone

00:06:31.131 --> 00:06:33.890
is going to have so many guns.

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:38.389
So if you yearn for the days of the wild,
wild West, then you ought to give Alto Clef

00:06:38.389 --> 00:06:39.389
your vote.

00:06:39.389 --> 00:06:40.389
Please don’t, though.

00:06:40.389 --> 00:06:42.509
We’re afraid of what he’ll do with more
power.

00:06:42.509 --> 00:06:48.360
Okay, so, if none of the rest of these candidates
have impressed you so far, how about a trailblazer?

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:50.919
A president that represents progress?

00:06:50.919 --> 00:06:55.039
Not only the first female president, but the
first Hindu president.

00:06:55.039 --> 00:06:59.180
And believe it or not, she’s actually testing
extremely well with men.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:04.240
It’s SCP-029, the Daughter of Shadows, of
the Kneel Before Me Party.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:09.050
She’s got a long history in leadership with
her generations of Thugee cultists, all of

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:11.270
whom are slavishly devoted to her.

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:15.310
They make KPOP stans look positively fairweather
in comparison.

00:07:15.310 --> 00:07:19.630
All her main policies involve worshipping
her, and be sure to avoid her most devoted

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:23.690
followers at the polls if you plan on not
voting for her - they might fly into a blind

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:25.210
rage and strangle you.

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:28.569
Well, that all got a little scary and violent,
didn’t it?

00:07:28.569 --> 00:07:33.190
Let’s move away from that, and instead,
think about the nation’s youth for a moment.

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:39.250
Children are the future, and nobody understands
children and their needs better than Dr. Wondertainment,

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:42.060
head of the Lovely Toys for Girls and Boys
Party.

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:47.300
Dr. Wondertainment is a figure of joy and
whimsy, and under President Wondertainment,

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:52.710
the country would become more amusingly whacky
than ever, thanks to every child being guaranteed

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:54.860
some of his marvelous anomalous toys.

00:07:54.860 --> 00:08:01.030
But he’s not all fun and games - Dr. Wondertainment
is also a businessman with a long track record

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:06.860
of success, despite being regularly attacked
by the SCP Foundation - so you know under

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:12.750
his presidency, the needs of small businesses
would be understood and taken care of.

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:18.520
But to become president, you need votes, and
to win votes, you need hearts and minds.

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:23.330
Sometimes, the best way to do this is to cultivate
a core voting block of completely devoted,

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.949
high-energy voters, like, say...

00:08:25.949 --> 00:08:26.949
Furries.

00:08:26.949 --> 00:08:33.240
That’s why we think SCP-1471, MalO, of the
Cursed Internet History Party, has what it

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:35.460
takes to battle their way to the top.

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:39.500
We really don’t know much about what MalO
wants to do, specifically, save for loosening

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:43.120
cybersecurity standards so everyone can download
its cursed app.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:47.880
But really, does a potential president really
need policies and ideals?

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.630
Is it not enough that they just make you feel
good?

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:55.649
Sometimes, it’s all just about vibes, and
I think that’s the bravest political stance

00:08:55.649 --> 00:08:56.830
to take of all.

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:59.940
Vote MalO, for a DeviantArt future.

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:04.370
Okay, okay, I think we went a little too far
there.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:06.560
But it’s part of a wider cultural trend.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:11.190
It seems today that all you see is violence
in movies and sex on TV.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:15.880
But where are those good, old-fashioned values
on which we used to rely?

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:22.149
Lucky there’s SCP-1867, Lord Blackwood,
for the British Imperial Party, to help set

00:09:22.149 --> 00:09:23.680
us all back on track.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:27.890
He’s an old-fashioned guy from a bygone
era, where women were women, and men were

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:29.690
telepathic sea slugs.

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:35.230
Think of him as a modern-day Teddy Roosevelt:
A renaissance man, skilled in warfare, business,

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:36.270
adventuring, and hunting.

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:39.570
He’s sure to win over voters with his trademark
folksy charm.

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:43.970
And his ability to spin captivating yarns
is likely to help him crush it at debates

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:45.740
and town hall meetings.

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:48.930
But that’s nothing compared to the kinds
of votes you can get when you’re able to

00:09:48.930 --> 00:09:52.990
literally control people’s minds with terrifying
psychic abilities.

00:09:52.990 --> 00:09:59.649
This is the primary advantage of SCP-035,
the Possessive Mask, representing the Mind-Melting

00:09:59.649 --> 00:10:01.580
Arcane Secrets Party.

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:06.710
SCP-035 has access to knowledge so terrifying
that even hearing it would cause you to be

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.810
plunged into a state of utterly irrevocable
madness.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:12.890
And he’s also a very persuasive speaker.

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:16.940
If you attend one of his speeches, you’ll
hear his words slithering into your mind,

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:21.440
slowly rearranging your thoughts like chess
pieces on a board until you’re hanging off

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:22.930
of his every word.

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:27.130
The one downside of his regime would be that
he’d need a revolving door of Vice Presidents

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:30.070
whose bodies he would steal and melt one by
one.

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:34.040
Sometimes, to get what you want, you need
to make compromises, folks.

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:39.329
Okay, before we get too deep into this anomalous
rabbit hole, let’s lean back out for a second

00:10:39.329 --> 00:10:43.250
and consider another SCP Foundation insider.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:48.450
Someone calm, someone measured, someone as
boring as muesli floating in a bowl full of

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:52.470
off-white paint, but reliable as a tough old
mule.

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:57.769
We are, of course, talking of Dr. Charles
Ogden Gears, of the “Doesn’t Like Attending

00:10:57.769 --> 00:10:58.769
Parties” Party.

00:10:58.769 --> 00:11:02.440
Look, we know he doesn’t play great for
the camera, but sometimes, all you need is

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:06.880
someone who’s got the personality of a piece
of drywall with a complex math equation written

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:09.880
on it, who’ll simply forge on and get the
job done.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:14.589
That’s what you can expect from Dr. Gears:
He’ll simply get the job done, no bells

00:11:14.589 --> 00:11:15.660
and whistles.

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:20.570
Our next candidate, on the other hand, loves
bells - slay bells, specifically.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.760
And that’s slay spelled S.L.A.Y.

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:29.399
That’s right, it’s SCP-4666, the Yule
Man, of the Christmas Party.

00:11:29.399 --> 00:11:33.329
He also wants to bring back traditional values
- Specifically, the values of pure, mortal

00:11:33.329 --> 00:11:38.990
terror, traditionally experienced by our ancient
ancestors while fleeing from primordial predators.

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:43.190
He will ensure that Christmas is celebrated,
even if his methods of Christmas celebration

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:44.570
are a little...

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:46.470
Well, let’s say “Severe.”

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:50.579
He’ll also introduce a number of policies
to fight climate change, making sure it’s

00:11:50.579 --> 00:11:52.970
always nice and cold during the winter.

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:56.900
After all, where’s the fun in standing outside
someone’s bedroom window on Christmas Eve

00:11:56.900 --> 00:12:00.130
if there isn’t nice, crunchy snow underfoot?

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:02.560
Maybe you don’t care about Christmas, though.

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:05.990
Maybe you just want a potential president
that’s young and hungry.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:08.090
And I mean really, really hungry.

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:13.470
We’re talking about SCP-082, Fernand the
Cannibal, of the Donner Party.

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:18.649
And honestly, he might be the most qualified
presidential candidate of anyone on this list.

00:12:18.649 --> 00:12:22.930
According to a written note that he sent us,
he’s actually been the president four times

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:23.930
already.

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:28.450
He also got six different PhDs in various
subjects from Harvard, Stanford, and Cornell

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:34.079
University, in addition to two Nobel Prizes,
a Pulitzer-prize-winning series of novels,

00:12:34.079 --> 00:12:38.350
and an Oscar-winning screenplay based on his
life as the first man on the moon.

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:44.130
He also apparently has a plan on how to simultaneously
end overpopulation and hunger, but he’s

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:47.060
been a little cagey about the specifics.

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:51.050
But let’s be real here, two of the most
important qualities of a presidential candidate

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:57.100
are clarity and transparency, and that’s
exactly what SCP-055, the Anti-Meme, of the

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:59.120
Non-Spherical Party, promises to offer.

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:00.120
It’s uh...

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:01.120
Um...

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:02.120
You know...

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:03.470
Damn it, it’s on the tip of my tongue...

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:05.130
Okay, it’s gone.

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.500
What were we talking about again?

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:13.120
Oh yeah, anomalous presidents, let’s move
on to the next one and see what he’s all

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:14.120
about.

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:17.139
This next candidate has a claim to the childhoods
of millions.

00:13:17.139 --> 00:13:20.990
He’s one of the world’s most successful
and acclaimed businessmen and is probably

00:13:20.990 --> 00:13:23.370
one of the most famous Americans worldwide.

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:30.440
It’s the cryogenically frozen head of Walt
Disney, also known as SCP-2805, Disney On

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:33.910
Ice, of the Corporate Consolidation Party.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:38.090
But it’s not just name recognition that
this beloved, beheaded businessman boasts;

00:13:38.090 --> 00:13:43.060
it’s also lots and lots of money, which
is valuable for someone campaigning for the

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:44.060
presidency.

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:47.860
And considering the fact that Disney seems
to be rapidly acquiring and owning everything,

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:52.709
I guess it makes sense in the long term that
he’d also end up owning America, too.

00:13:52.709 --> 00:13:58.070
But maybe you want a president with a better
head on their shoulders - or at least, a president

00:13:58.070 --> 00:14:00.870
whose head is actually attached to their shoulders.

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:04.519
You also want a president who is just a solid
guy.

00:14:04.519 --> 00:14:06.320
Solid as a rock.

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:10.980
Or perhaps concrete, and rebar, and Krylon-brand
spray paint...

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:16.270
We’re talking, of course, of SCP-173, of
the Weeping Angel Party.

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:19.550
With some politicians, you get the sense that
they’re only going to do your job when the

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:21.720
public is watching them like a hawk.

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:26.089
The second we look away, they slump back in
their chairs and grab the paddle ball.

00:14:26.089 --> 00:14:29.000
SCP-173 is literally the opposite.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:31.660
He does all his best work while nobody else
is watching.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:36.690
He’s no talk, all action, and you have to
appreciate that kind of dedication in this

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:37.899
day and age.

00:14:37.899 --> 00:14:42.580
When this serious Sculpture is president,
politics is a real snap!

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:46.329
Perhaps you’re of the opinion that the US
needs to take on a more hawkish approach to

00:14:46.329 --> 00:14:48.130
international affairs.

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:50.720
You miss the days of constant global wars
and fighting.

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:54.760
You’re the kind of person who listens to
Senator Armstrong ranting in Metal Gear Rising:

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:58.360
Revengeance and thinks, “Hey, this guy actually
has some pretty good ideas.”

00:14:58.360 --> 00:15:04.769
Then you’re going to love the idea of our
next prospective president: SCP-076-2, Able,

00:15:04.769 --> 00:15:06.880
from the Might Makes Right Party.

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:11.009
Able is really just about one thing, and one
thing only: Fighting.

00:15:11.009 --> 00:15:15.399
When he does inevitably lead the country into
a cataclysmic war, he’ll be the first president

00:15:15.399 --> 00:15:20.370
since Washington to charge in at the very
front of the army, a pair of ebony swords

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.490
drawn and ready to taste blood.

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:25.810
And if he dies on the job, all we need to
do is wait for him to rise from his black

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:28.060
sarcophagus for his term to resume.

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:29.240
How wonderful.

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:34.050
But hey, maybe after all this, you’re completely
disenchanted with the US political system.

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:39.690
You’re tired of presidents, of congress,
of democracy, of the whole complicated mess.

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:45.870
You want to return to a simpler age - an age
of unliteral decisions made by a single, all-powerful

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:46.870
ruler.

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:49.210
Pure monarchism, is what we’re saying.

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:52.510
And who’s a more eager monarch than The
Scarlet King?

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:56.630
This interdimensional nightmare has killed
more Gods than there are grains of sand on

00:15:56.630 --> 00:16:00.470
your nearest beach, so there’s probably
no problem on earth he can’t solve if he

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:02.709
puts his diabolical mind to it.

00:16:02.709 --> 00:16:06.060
A major downside of being under the Scarlet
King’s Rule is that it would be a lifetime

00:16:06.060 --> 00:16:10.380
appointment for him, and the Scarlet King
has an infinite lifespan.

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:14.220
Notions like “freedom”, “hope”, and
“joy“, will have to go out the window,

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:19.650
and instead be replaced with the classic concepts
of terror, rage, and horrendous primal violence.

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:24.430
With the Scarlet King in charge, he’s likely
to also reinstall the long-lost Daevite culture,

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:29.259
some of his most ardent worshippers, so expect
to learn a whole lot about different and interesting

00:16:29.259 --> 00:16:33.880
civilizations if the Scarlet King is able
to get his iron clutches on our reality.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:34.880
What?

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.660
Nobody ever said playing politics was nice,
folks.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:43.550
And there you have it: Our anomalous presidential
nominees, straight from the SCP Foundation.

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:44.930
Which one of these would you vote for?

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:47.100
Are there any nominations we missed?

00:16:47.100 --> 00:16:48.810
Let us know down in the comments.

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:51.899
And remember: Whoever wins, we lose.

00:16:51.899 --> 00:16:55.180
Well... except 999, that’d be a pretty sweet
deal.

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:56.560
Now go check out “DR.

00:16:56.560 --> 00:17:03.420
BRIGHT FOR PRESIDENT SCP-4444 - Bush v. Gore”
and “SCP-001 - The Scarlet King” for more

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:04.730
on your future leaders!

